function formatExamDate(value){if(!value)return "—";const raw=String(value);const d=new Date(/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(raw)?raw+"T12:00:00":raw);return Number.isNaN(d.getTime())?raw:d.toLocaleDateString("hi-IN",{day:"2-digit",month:"2-digit",year:"numeric"});}
const ttKey="schooldesk_timetable_v1", examKey="schooldesk_exam_scheme_v1", matKey="schooldesk_materials_v1", reqKey="schooldesk_student_requests_v1", subKey="schooldesk_assignment_submissions_v1";
